# retifs as the user's launch_daemon job: the retifs daemon at login, after
# Reticulum (x-vnd.prns-prnsd, the Prns package's prnsd). A package puts this
# in data/user_launch/ (every user) with its own paths; by hand, copy it to
# ~/config/settings/launch/retifs with APP replaced by the app folder, then
# log in again.

job x-vnd.retifs-daemon {
	launch APP/bin/retifsd
	requires x-vnd.prns-prnsd
}
